  to_jsonb($t$His press "Build it" at 00:46 CST 2026-11-24 in the W3 thread (ruling row 517; Wall 11419). His presses in W4's thread as the Wall gives them: "Write all three" (Wall 11543), "Write the fix" (Wall 11556), "Write it now" (Wall 11559). His words of 09:18 CST 2026-11-24 as Wall 11554 quotes them: "i see single judge ... we don't have single judge anymore". W3 did not see the cards or the presses in W4's thread.$t$::text),
